    "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#bc-container \"The container of a browsing context bc is the browsing context container whose nested browsing context is bc, or null if there is no such element.\" \"Certain elements (for example, iframe elements) can instantiate further browsing contexts. These elements are called browsing context containers.\" The container is never a browsing context. The container is a iframe/embed/object that _has_ a browsing context, or it's null if the browsing context isn't nested.",
